00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.040
 hadn't seen

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.810
 Said just a place to crash one night Swear I'll be gone by

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.900
 morning light

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.980
 But he overslept and missed his call Said one more night I

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.100
've lost it all

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.090
 They'd been through hell, I gave him a shot But the c

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:22.300
ravings came and he just forgot

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.290
 I gave you my couch, gave you a break Thought you'd stay

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.560
 clean for everyone's

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.460
 sake But you dropped at G when the house went still Now you

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.080
're shaking hard and getting

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:35.070
 your fill I went to bed, you went to war Shaking our

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:54.120
