00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.480
 Lauren called, says she's still got hope Jorah's shadow

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.800
 slipping down a slope

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.950
 It's a pile of moments you've let slide by While you chase

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.400
