00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:08.390
 They'd come tomorrow if you'd just say when But you're

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.360
 locked in the arms of your oldest

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:16.640
 friend And he don't care if you wake again

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:19.470
 I gave you my couch, gave you a break Thought you'd stay

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.680
 clean for everyone's

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:24.780
 sake But you dropped at G when the house went still Now you

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:25.180
're shaking hard and getting

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:35.820
 your fill I went to bed and banged the floor

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.700
 It wasn't smack, it wasn't blow This shit creeps in quiet

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.200
 and steals the show

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.820
 Your eyes rolled back, your fists went tight You were

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.760
 drowning dry in the pale porch like

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:49.100
 You said it's GBH or maybe G But you were gone before it's

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:49.780
